# Real provider captures. NEVER COMMITTED.
#
# These are unsanitized production records from Cloudflare, DataDome, F5 ASM and
# nginx: they contain real client addresses, headers, cookies and payloads. They
# are useful for validating parsers against the shapes providers actually emit,
# and they must not leave this machine.
#
# Sanitized samples for tests belong in backend/test/fixtures/, where a CI guard
# checks them for credentials and personal data.
/raw/
raw/

